@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title RestroVibes - Table Management & Admin Operations

actor Restaurateur
actor Admin
participant "Web Interface" as Web
participant "TableController" as Table
participant "AppointmentController" as Appt
participant "ScoringEngine" as Score
participant "Database" as DB
participant "FileSystem" as FS

== Create Table ==

Restaurateur -> Web : Add table
Web -> Table : POST /api/tables\n{ restaurateurId, table_number, capacity }
Table -> Table : Verify role + ownership
Table -> DB : Check unique constraint
Table -> DB : INSERT INTO tables\n(is_active=true, images=[])
DB --> Table : Created
Table --> Web : 201 { table }

== Upload Table Images ==

Restaurateur -> Web : Select images (max 10)
Web -> Table : POST /api/uploads/tables/:id/images\nmultipart/form-data
Table -> Table : Multer: validate types\n(jpeg, jpg, png, webp)\nMax 5MB per file
Table -> FS : Save to uploads/\n{timestamp}-{random}.{ext}
FS --> Table : Saved
Table -> DB : UPDATE images array
DB --> Table : Updated
Table --> Web : 200 { images }

== Delete Table Image ==

Restaurateur -> Web : Remove image
Web -> Table : DELETE /api/uploads/tables/:id/images/:filename
Table -> DB : Filter images array
Table -> FS : fs.unlinkSync(filename)
FS --> Table : Deleted
Table -> DB : UPDATE images
Table --> Web : 200 Done

== Update Table ==

Restaurateur -> Web : Edit table
Web -> Table : PUT /api/tables/:id\n{ table_number, capacity, is_active }
Table -> Table : Ownership check
Table -> DB : UPDATE table fields
Table --> Web : 200 Updated

== Delete Table ==

Restaurateur -> Web : Delete table
Web -> Table : DELETE /api/tables/:id
Table -> Table : Ownership check
Table -> DB : DELETE FROM tables
Table --> Web : 200 Deleted

== View Restaurant Tables ==

Restaurateur -> Web : View my tables
Web -> Table : GET /api/tables/restaurant/:id
Table -> DB : SELECT WHERE restaurateur_id\nORDER BY table_number
DB --> Table : Table list
Table --> Web : [{ table_number, capacity,\nimages, is_active }]

== Admin: Create User (Any Role) ==

Admin -> Web : Create user
Web -> Appt : POST /api/auth/register\n(Authorization: Bearer <admin>)
Appt -> Appt : Verify admin role\nAllowed: ["client","restaurateurs","admin"]
Appt -> DB : Create user with role
Appt --> Web : 201 { user info }

== Admin: Delete User ==

Admin -> Web : Delete user
Web -> Appt : DELETE /api/users/delete/:id
Appt -> DB : Verify target not admin
Appt -> DB : UPDATE related appointments\n-> "cancelled"
Appt -> DB : DELETE FROM users
Appt --> Web : 200 Deleted

== Admin: Cancel Any Appointment ==

Admin -> Web : Cancel appointment
Web -> Appt : PUT /api/appointments/:id/cancel
Appt -> Appt : Admin bypass: no ownership check
Appt -> DB : UPDATE status -> "cancelled"
Appt --> Web : 200 Cancelled

== Admin: Manual Lottery Resolve ==

Admin -> Web : Resolve contested slot
Web -> Appt : POST /api/lottery/resolve\n{ restaurantId, date, timeSlot }
Appt -> Appt : Admin-only middleware
Appt -> DB : Fetch lottery entries
Appt -> Appt : Weighted random select
Appt -> DB : Winner -> accepted\nLosers -> cancelled
Appt --> Web : 200 Resolved

== Admin: Backfill Penalties ==

Admin -> Web : Recalculate all scores
Web -> Appt : POST /api/appointments/admin/backfill-penalties
Appt -> DB : SELECT clients
loop Per client
    Appt -> Score : recalculatePenalty(id)
    Score -> DB : Fetch + update
end
Appt --> Web : 200 All recalculated

@enduml
